     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi Folks, </span><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Getting back into the swing of things for spring quarter? Come to D-RUG for our first meeting!</span><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Our meeting time this quarter will be the same as last quarter (according to our poll, n=10): </div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><ul><li><b>Tuesdays from <span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span>10am-12pm</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><b>, in the Data Science Initiative (DSI) space*, in Shields 360</b></span></li></ul><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">If you haven&#39;t been to the DSI conference/classroom space, </span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">see directions below</span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">, it&#39;s great and we are happy to get to use it.</span></div></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Our first open work session of the quarter will be this coming Tuesday, April 11, from <span><span>10am-12pm</span></span> in Shields 360.  Bring your R questions and projects, and we&#39;ll see you there!</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Adios,</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Ryan</div><div><h1 style=\"font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\">*Data Science Initiative - Directions</font></h1><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">On campus, we&#39;re in<span> </span></span><a href=\"http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=114\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b%3D114&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466983794000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zKPYYhQN3Tjc126SZa4M_\">Shields Library</a><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><span> </span>Davis, CA</span><p style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"></p><h1 style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Within Shields Library</h1><ul style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><li style=\"margin-left:15px\">Walk in the main entrance of the library, go up the first set of stairs.</li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\">Go up the second set of stairs on the right side</li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\">Go through the double doors at the top of the stairs and turn left.</li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\">Walk all the way to the end of the corridor.</li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\">To the right of the exit sign is the door to room 362. Go around the corner to the door right next to the water fountain. You&#39;re there.</li></ul><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">The DSI is in the space previously occupied by the Institute of Governmental Affairs (IGA).</span></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-spa